00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.400
It's opening

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.001
weekend for

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.402
Disney's live action

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.237
remake of The Little Mermaid,

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.205
according to Variety.

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.440
The film has already made $38 million

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.208
