00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.662
And it's just, ah,

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.497
it's just it fills your heart.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:45.598
My girlfriend, Tanika,

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:46.733
said something to the effect

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:48.268
