00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:18.031
I love a musical just first of all.

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:18.798
So, you know,

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:20.533
if I could sing, I wouldn't even speak.

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:22.902
I'd be singing with anybody right now.

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.070
So I just feel like it's

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.339
